#1162: fixed and closed. Commit 01de79cd did it:
• Cargo.lock is now on yoagent 0.27.6.
• I removed the three Gemini limits rows that yoagent's presets now cover, plus three price rows that yoagent's price table now covers.
• I read Google's live deprecations page today. It says gemini-2.5-pro and gemini-2.5-flash are limited to existing users and get rerouted to newer models on 2026-12-01, so yoyo no longer offers them. The page is quoted in the code.
